ck failed":"錢包解鎖失敗","The passphrase entered for the wallet decryption was incorrect.":"輸入要用來解密錢包的密碼不對。","Wallet decryption failed":"錢包解密失敗","Wallet passphrase was successfully changed.":"錢包密碼改成功了。","Warning: The Caps Lock key is on!":"警告: 大寫字母鎖定作用中！","Network Alert":"網路警報","Quantity:":"數目:","Bytes:":"位元組數:","Amount:":"金額:","Priority:":"優先度:","Fee:":"手續費:","Low Output:":"低輸出:","After Fee:":"計費後金額:","Change:":"找零金額:","(un)select all":"全選或全不選","Tree mode":"樹狀模式","List mode":"列表模式","Amount":"金額","Date":"日期","Confirmations":"確認次數","Confirmed":"已確定","Priority":"優先度","Copy address":"複製位址","Copy label":"複製標記","Copy amount":"複製金額","Copy transaction ID":"複製交易識別碼","Copy quantity":"複製數目","Copy fee":"複製手續費","Copy after fee":"複製計費後金額","Copy bytes":"複製位元組數","Copy priority":"複製優先度","Copy low output":"複製低輸出","Copy change":"複製找零金額","highest":"最高","high":"高","medium-high":"中高","medium":"中等","low-medium":"中低","low":"低","lowest":"最低","yes":"是","no":"否","change from %1 (%2)":"找零前是 %1 (%2)","(change)":"(找零)","Edit Address":"編輯位址","&Label":"標記","&Address":"位址","New receiving address":"造新的收款位址","New sending address":"造新的付款位址","Edit receiving address":"編輯收款位址","Edit sending address":"編輯付款位址","The entered address \"%1\" is already in the address book.":"輸入的位址 %1 在位址簿中已經有了。","Could not unlock wallet.":"沒辦法把錢包解鎖。","New key generation failed.":"產生新的密鑰失敗了。","&Information":"資訊","Client name":"客戶端軟體名稱","N/A":"未知","Client version":"客戶端軟體版本","Using OpenSSL version":"使用的 OpenSSL 版本","Build date":"建置日期","Startup time":"啓動時間","Network":"網路","Number of connections":"連線數","Block chain":"區塊鏈","Current number of blocks":"目前區塊數","Estimated total blocks":"估計總區塊數","Last block time":"最近區塊時間","Debug log file":"除錯紀錄檔","&Open":"開啓","&Console":"主控台","Clear console":"清主控台","Use up and down arrows to navigate history, and <b>Ctrl-L</b> to clear screen.":"請用上下游標鍵來瀏覽先前指令的紀錄，並用 <b>Ctrl-L</b> 來清理畫面。","Type <b>help</b> for an overview of available commands.":"請打 <b>help</b> 來看可用指令的簡介。","Open until %1":"要到 %1 才確定","%1/offl